#: kio_man.cpp:1380
msgid ""
"Could not find the sgml2roff program on your system. Please install it, if "
"necessary, and extend the search path by adjusting the environment variable "
"PATH before starting KDE."
msgstr ""
"Ne mogu pronaći sgml2roff program na vašem sistemu. Instaliraj te ga, ako "
"je potrebno. Takošer, možete proširiti pretragu tako što ćete podesiti "
"varijablu PATH na drugu vrijednost prije pokretanja KDE-a."

